  "title": "Enact to Host First Quarter 2026 Earnings Call May 6th",
  "summary": "RALEIGH, N.C., April 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Enact Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: ACT) (Enact) announced it will issue its first quarter earnings release after the market closes on May 5, 2026. Enact will host a conference call to review first quarter 2026 financial results on May 6, 2026 at 8:00",
